{'symbol': 'BMY', 'date': '2022-11-29 08:00:00', 'title': 'ENVISAGENICS ANNOUNCES RESEARCH COLLABORATION WITH BRISTOL MYERS SQUIBB', 'text': 'COLLABORATION WILL LEVERAGE ENVISAGENICS\' SPLICECORE® AI PLATFORM FOR ACCELERATED DISCOVERY AND DEVELOPMENT OF ONCOLOGY THERAPEUTIC CANDIDATES NEW YORK , NOV. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ENVISAGENICS, AN ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE ("AI")-DRIVEN BIOTECHNOLOGY COMPANY THAT DELIVERS THERAPIES FOR RNA SPLICING DISEASES, TODAY ANNOUNCED A RESEARCH COLLABORATION AGREEMENT WITH BRISTOL MYERS SQUIBB \xa0(NYSE: BMY). THE MULTI-YEAR COLLABORATION WILL LEVERAGE ENVISAGENICS\' SPLICECORE® AI PLATFORM TO IDENTIFY ALTERNATIVE SPLICING DERIVED TARGETS FOR THERAPEUTIC DEVELOPMENT TO EXPAND BRISTOL MYERS SQUIBB\'S VAST ONCOLOGY PIPELINE.'}